# Production build variables. Committed on purpose.
#
# A Turnstile site key is public by design - it is rendered into the page and
# visible to anyone who views source - so it is configuration, not a secret.
# Its matching secret key is what must never be here: that lives as an
# encrypted Worker secret, TURNSTILE_SECRET, set in the Cloudflare dashboard.
#
# This file is what puts the key in front of the builder. Deploys run from a
# push to main, so anything the build needs has to be in the repository:
# .env.local is gitignored and reaches no deploy, and a dashboard build
# variable would be invisible here and lost on a fresh clone.
#
# Vite loads .env.production for `vite build` only, never for `vite dev`, so a
# local dev run still falls back to the test key in src/lib/turnstile.ts and
# needs no account. scripts/check-build.mjs fails the build if this key ever
# goes missing again.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY="0x4AAAAAAFDAFjSI-lrIcj1S"
